{"compatibility":"as-is","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: as-is.

Protected data: `obs_t_calib`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

No changes were required. The protected observation `obs_t_calib` is a top-level data variable and is observed exactly once with a plain built-in sampling statement. The parameter `sigma_t` has a built-in prior before it is used in the observation model.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int N_calibrations;
  array[N_calibrations] real obs_t_calib; // seconds
}

parameters {
  real<lower=0> sigma_t; // seconds
}

model {
  // Prior model
  sigma_t ~ normal(0, 0.5);

  // Observational model
  obs_t_calib ~ normal(rep_vector(0, N_calibrations), sigma_t);
}

